    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST e‑Way Bill</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Every consignment whose value exceeds ₹50,000 must be accompanied by a valid e‑Way bill generated on the GST portal. The bill records the shipper’s GSTIN, the consignee’s details, and the exact description of goods. For Delhi to Surat transport, the e‑Way bill is verified at checkpoints, ensuring smooth movement across state borders.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR) / Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Issued by the transporter, the LR serves as the legal proof of receipt of goods. It lists the weight, quantity, and condition of each item, and is signed by both the mover and the client.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>An IBA‑approved LR is mandatory for interstate moves and is the primary document for claim settlement</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IRDAI‑registered Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A comprehensive policy covering 100 % of the declared value protects against accidental collision, natural calamities, and delays caused by strikes or road blockades. The insurance, mandated by the Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (IRDAI), is activated once the LR is signed and the e‑Way bill is generated.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Choosing a reputable operator—such as the <em>local top 10 packers and movers in Delhi NCR</em> or specialized firms like <em>HCL Packers and Movers Surat Gujarat</em>—ensures that these documents are prepared correctly.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Companies operating in <em>central Delhi</em> or the <em>Khanpur Raju Park Delhi</em> area often have dedicated compliance teams that handle e‑Way bill generation and LR issuance on behalf of the client.</span></li></ul>

<p>For businesses looking for a trusted partner, <em>CNR Cargo Movers Surat Gujarat GST No</em> is a notable example that combines GST compliance with seamless insurance integration. When you engage such movers, you benefit from a single point of contact for paperwork, real‑time tracking, and instant claim processing under the marine transit policy.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">In summary, a smooth <strong>Delhi to Surat transport</strong> hinges on three pillars: a valid GST e‑Way bill, an IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt, and a full‑value IRDAI marine insurance cover.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>By selecting a certified mover from the <em>local top 10 packers and movers in Delhi NCR</em> or a reputable Surat‑based firm, you guarantee legal compliance and peace of mind throughout the journey.</span></li></ul></div>
