      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Doorstep Delivery Handover, Inventory Verification &amp; Placement at Surat</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At Surat, the final delivery and uncrating protocol is designed to ensure accuracy, safety, and a pristine presentation for the client. The process begins with a daylight verification against the original inventory bilty. This step confirms that every item listed on the bilty arrives in the correct quantity and condition before any unpacking starts.</p>

